WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:05.505
FOR THEIR KIDS. GARY GRUMBACH

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:07.340
HAS THE VIDEO.

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:08.742
&gt;&gt; TONIGHT. TWO PARENTS FACING

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:10.176
CHARGES AFTER A HOUSE PARTY AT

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:13.546
THEIR HOME IN NORTHERN VIRGINIA

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:15.015
GOT OUT OF CONTROL. FAIRFAX

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:17.017
COUNTY POLICE SAY THEY ARRIVED

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:18.518
ON SCENE LAST WEEK TO FIND

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.286
HUNDREDS OF TEENAGERS AT A

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:22.055
PARTY WITH UNDERAGE DRINKING

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.455
POLICE BLURRING THE FACES OF

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:23.857
MINORS.

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:26.159
&gt;&gt; NO, WE HAVEN'T HAD ANY

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.893
ALCOHOL. WE'VE BEEN MAKING. ARE

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.561
YOU JOKING?

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:30.730
&gt;&gt; NO BODY CAMERA VIDEO SHOWS

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:32.565
LISA VAUGHAN, THE MOTHER OF TWO

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:34.367
TEENAGE BOYS, TRYING TO ASSURE

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:34.701
OFFICERS THERE'S NO ALCOHOL

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:35.568
INVOLVED.

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.903
&gt;&gt; WE'VE BEEN MAKING SURE

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:38.371
THERE'S NO BACKPACKS, NO

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:39.572
ALCOHOL. YOU DON'T SMELL IT IN

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:40.540
THE AIR RIGHT NOW? NO, I DON'T

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:42.375
SMELL ANYTHING.

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:42.542
&gt;&gt; THEN THE PARTY STARTS TO POP

00:00:42.409 --> 00:00:45.845
OFF.

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:47.080
&gt;&gt; GETTING EVERYBODY OUT.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:49.115
&gt;&gt; POLICE SAY SOME OF THE TEENS

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:50.884
SET OFF FIREWORKS AS OFFICERS

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:51.651
TRIED TO DISPERSE THE

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:53.086
PARTYGOERS.

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:54.454
&gt;&gt; GO HOME.

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:55.989
&gt;&gt; LISA AND HER HUSBAND, AUBREY

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:57.290
VAUGHAN, WERE CHARGED WITH

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:59.559
CONTRIBUTING TO THE DELINQUENCY

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:59.926
OF A MINOR AND MAINTAINING A

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:01.628
COMMON NUISANCE.

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:02.529
&gt;&gt; MAKE SURE IT'S NOT A FIRE

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:03.763
JUST IN CASE.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:05.265
&gt;&gt; POLICE SAY A PARTY INVITE

00:01:03.797 --> 00:01:07.100
WAS SHARED ONLINE, LEADING TO

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:09.969
FRIDAY NIGHT MAYHEM IN AN

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:11.404
OTHERWISE QUIET COMMUNITY.

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:13.239
AUBREY VAUGHAN TELLING A LOCAL

00:01:11.438 --> 00:01:14.574
WASHINGTON, D.C. TELEVISION

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:15.642
STATION HE'S EMBARRASSED.

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.910
&gt;&gt; WE DEFINITELY DIDN'T ASK FOR

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:18.044
THIS AND THESE KIDS HAVE

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:19.079
BEHAVED THIS WAY. I APOLOGIZE

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:21.514
TO EVERYONE THAT IT SHOULD

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:22.682
NEVER HAPPEN. AND THE LESSON IS

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:24.017
MONITOR SNAPCHAT, RIGHT?

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:25.785
&gt;&gt; ADDING THEY ASKED ANYONE WHO

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:27.020
CAME WITH ALCOHOL TO LEAVE.

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:28.354
&gt;&gt; THERE WAS ZERO ALCOHOL

00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:29.389
ALLOWED AT OUR PARTY.

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:31.224
&gt;&gt; FAIRFAX COUNTY POLICE CHIEF

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:32.325
KEVIN DAVIS SAYS THIS INCIDENT

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:34.461
SHOULD SERVE AS A REMINDER TO

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:35.595
OTHER PARENTS OF THEIR

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:37.664
RESPONSIBILITIES AS ADULTS AND

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:37.897
THE LEGAL CONSEQUENCES OF THEIR

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:39.666
ACTIONS.

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:40.900
&gt;&gt; WE WANT ALL PARENTS TO BE

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:42.669
ABLE TO MAKE GOOD DECISIONS FOR

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:44.904
THEIR KIDS, BUT PARENTS HAVE TO

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:45.638
BE PARENTS. ADULTS HAVE TO BE

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:47.040
ADULTS.

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:48.308
&gt;&gt; CHIEF KEVIN DAVIS THEY'RE

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:50.276
URGING PARENTS TO BE AWARE OF

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:51.744
THEIR KIDS ACTIVITIES ON SOCIAL

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.146
MEDIA. AUBREY AND LISA VAUGHAN

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:54.914
ARE OUT ON BAIL AND HAVE

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:55.115
HEARINGS IN THEIR CASE IN THE

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:55.115
COMING WEEKS

